<title>SOUTH KOREA: Samsung delivers China paging system.</title>
<headline>Samsung delivers China paging system.</headline>
<dateline>SEOUL 1996-11-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>South Korea's Samsung Electronics Co Ltd said on Wednesday it had completed a paging system in Shanghai, China.</p>
<p>The system, valued at around $1 million and with the capacity to handle 1.2 million subscribers, was completed on a turnkey basis and delivered to Shanghai Guomai Communications Co Ltd, a Samsung statement said.</p>
<p>Samsung Electronics is a unit of the Samsung Group.</p>
<p>-- Seoul Newsroom (822) 727 5644</p>
